<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-BELGIUM BEAT DENMARK 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP MATCH.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BELGIUM BEAT DENMARK 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium beat Denmark 3-2 in</p>
<p>their Davis Cup Europe-Africa zone group one second round tie on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>Results (Belgians names first):</p>
<p>Doubles (postponed from Saturday)</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf/Libor Bimek lost to Frederik Fetterlein/</p>
<p>Kenneth Carlsen 3-6 5-7 1-6 6-4</p>
<p>Reverse singles:</p>
<p>Johan Van Herck beat Kenneth Carlssen 6-4 6-1 7-5</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf beat Frederik Fetterlein 6-0 6-4 3-6 2-6 6-1</p>
</text>
